1501 0 obj
<<
/Title (Each of 13 iterations: examine \(Q0, Q-1\). If 01, do A <- A + M. If 10, do A <- A - M. If 00 or 11, do nothing. Arithmetic-right-shift the combined A:Q:Q-1 register one place \(sign-extending A's top bit\), which simultaneously  shifts A's new LSB into Q's MSB and Q's old LSB into Q-1. Decrement the counter; repeat until it reaches zero. After 13 iterations, the signed 26-bit product is the concatenation A:Q.)
/Dest [22 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1473 0 R
/Prev 1500 0 R
/Next 1490 0 R
>>
endobj
